{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/paramount-towers-damac-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":678,"crm_id":"1143","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Paramount Towers","slug":"paramount-towers-damac-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2019","developer":"Damac Properties","price":1800000,"display_price":"1.8M","lattitude":25.1897158,"longitude":55.2647212176318,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Damac Paramount Towers consists of four Hollywood-style buildings, approximately 270 meters high. Three towers contain residential units, namely <strong>studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms</strong>, while the fourth is occupied by a hotel. All four towers are united by a multi-level podium of multifunctional purpose with restaurants and bars, event halls, fitness centers, spas, swimming pools with a huge sun terrace and panoramic views of the area, recreation areas, cinemas, children's club and shopping area.</p><p>Each residence of the complex is characterized by elegant, modern and functional design. The complex is located in the Business Bay area and faces directly onto Al Abraj Road, which connects to the Ras Al Khor highway. The favorable location makes it easy to move around the city to neighboring areas. You can use public transportation - metro or bus. Business Bay bus stop is within walking distance, as well as Financial Center and Business Bay metro stations.</p><p>A variety of cafes and restaurants can be found near DAMAC Paramount Towers, including Fuchsia Urban Thai, Taipei Dao, Zen Restaurant and The Espresso Lab, while nearby supermarkets and grocery stores include West Zone Supermarket, Spinneys and Carrefour.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images"